# MT108 (ST77916 360x360 LCD): see devices/mt108/SPEC.md. Merge on top of
# the device config. DT touch: cst0xx_ts only plus btl_ts (no hyn_ts node;
# bd1xxx_hr (BD1820): stock measurement path, untested on hardware, enabled as on stock). sprd_aod_idle is NOT enabled (CO5300 only).
# hrs3xxx accepts HRS3918 (id 0x27) and HRS3300 (id 0x21, the stock
# config's chip); probe and power only unless the stock measurement code is
# linked (HRS3XXX_TYHX_BLOB_HRS3300, scripts/watch_build.sh with
# HRS_STOCK_BOOT_IMG), which then serves only the HRS3300 (id 0x21).
CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_CST0XX=y
CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_BTL=y
# no hyn_ts node, and the ST77916 LCD must never get CO5300 idle commands
# CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_CST9217 is not set
# CONFIG_SPRD_AOD_IDLE is not set
CONFIG_INPUT_SENSORS_HRS3XXX=y
CONFIG_HEARTRATE_HRS3918=y
CONFIG_HEARTRATE_HRS3300=y
CONFIG_SENSORS_SC7A22=y
# "QST,qmax981" matches qma6981.c
CONFIG_INPUT_QMA6981_I2C=y
# "magnetic,och1970" (hall sensor, polled, power-down unless enabled)
CONFIG_SENSORS_OCH1970=y
CONFIG_INPUT_SENSORS_BD1XXX=y
CONFIG_HEARTRATE_BD1820=y
